              "accessTokenUrl": "https://{account-domain}.aha.io/oauth/token",
              "credentials": {
                "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
                "clientSecret": "{{clientSecret}}"
              }
            }
          },
          "docs": "Many records throughout Aha! have an associated description: features, requirements, ideas, etc. You can find the ID of a record's description within the `description` attribute returned by any record show endpoint. You can then use that description ID to create an attachment on the record by providing it as the `note_id` URL parameter for this endpoint."
        },
